{"3072760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retro Relics", "steam_appid": 3072760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Retro Relics</i></strong>, you follow in the footsteps of your late Grandpa, a passionate metal detectorist. Explore nature and search for various relics with your metal detector. Roam freely with no time limits - detect, dig, help others find their lost belongings, and complete your coin and relics collection! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/8dc82f4e65efd91b0d17b3a741373fc3.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find relics from all eras (from bronze age to modern) with the help of your metal detector: coins, buttons, buckles, jewellery, military, religious relics and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c53e9b403e9e4c503c41a218fdbcd32d.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of ancient ruins, explore lush forests, dusty fields and relax on a treasure hunt at the beach! Many animals can be spotted on your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/2421820a9e0e0c217664df7ac944bc18.avif?t=1767807975\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/94cd0c0d2967bd0e10e1bb14826cdb03.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on numerous search missions for the local people in your town, including a sassy old lady at her villa, a slightly confused hunter and many more interesting characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/1097bab360bede9f86330a0556e941bc.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more than 150 different relics from various eras and rarities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your personal museum and display your rarest and prettiest finds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/e512c1bf2db8a8101f3b3c5a39af8949.avif?t=1767807975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras_big/e512c1bf2db8a8101f3b3c5a39af8949.avif?t=1767807975 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/752b889fcc889b17e0d5d39b589478f4.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People don't only lose treasures - help nature by picking up trash and watch animals come back to their former habitats:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/21bf27b1bfa4252cfc0a0385cdffe4fa.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your cozy home you can sell artifacts, accept new missions via email, manage your collection and upgrade your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fc983033ccdb59692b515720d936d1b8.avif?t=1767807975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras_big/fc983033ccdb59692b515720d936d1b8.avif?t=1767807975 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About me:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Jonas, 31 years old, from Germany. I'm a solo developer working on Retro Relics in my free time. I'm a passionate metal detectorist myself and have many years of experience in the hobby. Many of the relics you can find in the game, I have found myself in real life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to take part in the development of Retro Relics, have feedback or ideas for the game, you are very welcome to my small Discord community:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/8c170ef432b48231e5120de9e19a1564.avif?t=1767807975\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Retro Relics</i></strong>, you follow in the footsteps of your late Grandpa, a passionate metal detectorist. Explore nature and search for various relics with your metal detector. Roam freely with no time limits - detect, dig, help others find their lost belongings, and complete your coin and relics collection! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/8dc82f4e65efd91b0d17b3a741373fc3.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find relics from all eras (from bronze age to modern) with the help of your metal detector: coins, buttons, buckles, jewellery, military, religious relics and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c53e9b403e9e4c503c41a218fdbcd32d.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of ancient ruins, explore lush forests, dusty fields and relax on a treasure hunt at the beach! Many animals can be spotted on your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/2421820a9e0e0c217664df7ac944bc18.avif?t=1767807975\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/94cd0c0d2967bd0e10e1bb14826cdb03.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on numerous search missions for the local people in your town, including a sassy old lady at her villa, a slightly confused hunter and many more interesting characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/1097bab360bede9f86330a0556e941bc.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more than 150 different relics from various eras and rarities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your personal museum and display your rarest and prettiest finds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/e512c1bf2db8a8101f3b3c5a39af8949.avif?t=1767807975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras_big/e512c1bf2db8a8101f3b3c5a39af8949.avif?t=1767807975 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/752b889fcc889b17e0d5d39b589478f4.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People don't only lose treasures - help nature by picking up trash and watch animals come back to their former habitats:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/21bf27b1bfa4252cfc0a0385cdffe4fa.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your cozy home you can sell artifacts, accept new missions via email, manage your collection and upgrade your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fc983033ccdb59692b515720d936d1b8.avif?t=1767807975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras_big/fc983033ccdb59692b515720d936d1b8.avif?t=1767807975 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About me:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Jonas, 31 years old, from Germany. I'm a solo developer working on Retro Relics in my free time. I'm a passionate metal detectorist myself and have many years of experience in the hobby. Many of the relics you can find in the game, I have found myself in real life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to take part in the development of Retro Relics, have feedback or ideas for the game, you are very welcome to my small Discord community:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/8c170ef432b48231e5120de9e19a1564.avif?t=1767807975\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In Retro Relics, you follow in the footsteps of your late Grandpa, a passionate metal detectorist. Explore nature and search for various relics with your metal detector. Roam freely with no time limits-detect, dig, help others find their lost belongings, and complete your coin and relics collection!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Retro Relics is a relatively short but satisfying game that felt as though I was having a conversation with the developer, enthusing about their passion for metal detecting. Overall, I enjoyed learning about the metal detecting hobby as I searched for buried items, built up my collection, and ultimately completed grandpa’s final request.”<br>8/9 – LadiesGamers<br><br>“There’s something strangely comforting about slow discoveries. Retro Relics leans into that feeling completely: the soft crunch of footsteps on grass, the gentle beep of a metal detector, and the small thrill of uncovering something forgotten beneath the soil. It isn’t loud, flashy, or urgent, and that’s exactly the point. Retro Relics invites you to take your time, wander through nature, and see what stories m